mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[A Robust Weapon Crafting System]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat monsters in the field and use the various items you obtain from them to craft weapons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make and use powerful weapons from the original webtoon like Kasaka's Venom Fang and the Demon King's Daggers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Solo Leveling, the webtoon with 14.3 billion views worldwide, is now an action RPG game! Help our hero grow from his humble E-Rank beginnings.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Indonesian, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Thai, Portuguese - Brazil, Danish, Dutch, Malay, Norwegian, Polish, Swedish, Turkish, Filipino<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2373990/018068a74847b3953278efacca07cfbe537a46c7/header.jpg?t=1781758887", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2373990/0dcee177a49226128b2b90c0b98652079a303d4b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781758887", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2373990/0dcee177a49226128b2b90c0b98652079a303d4b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781758887", "website": "https://slvariseoverdrive.netmarble.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-bit Required)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5 4460 3.2 GHz Over or AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA® GeForce GTX™ 1050 Over<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><